# Foundry V13+ only

This module targets Foundry **13+** (verified on **14**). Do not use, write, or add compatibility shims for pre-V13 APIs.

## ActiveEffect

- Use `effect.start.round` / `turn` / `combat` / `time` — never `duration.startRound`, `duration.startTurn`, `duration.startTime`, or `duration.combat`
- Duration field is `duration.units` (plural), not `duration.unit`
- Time units are `turns` / `rounds`, not singular `turn` / `round`

## Applications & hooks

- Prefer `ApplicationV2` / `DialogV2` and `foundry.applications.*`
- Use `renderChatMessageHTML` — not `renderChatMessage`
- Treat render hooks as receiving `HTMLElement`, not jQuery

## Utilities & documents

- Use `foundry.utils.deepClone` — not `foundry.utils.duplicate`
- ChatMessage author is `message.author` — not `message.user`
- Private GM roll mode via `CONST.DICE_ROLL_MODES.PRIVATE` / `CONFIG.ChatMessage.modes` — not `"gmroll"`

## dnd5e

- Prefer `system.rider.statuses` over writing `flags.dnd5e.riders`
- Prefer modern rider APIs (`collectRiders`) over deprecated wrappers when both exist
- Status/condition images use `img`, not `icon`

Do not add dual legacy/modern code paths “just in case.” Target current Foundry + dnd5e only.
